      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/9f8e36/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-13T21:40:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So let me start off by stating what may be obvious to some but I don't have access to the Backer stuff. I have preordered but that's it right now. With that being said, I'm curious about 2 things:</p>\n<p>1) Does this version of Sentinels have a Nemesis option? Can we make villains that way?</p>\n<p>2) And if so, then how do we play it? Do people GMing just decide who&nbsp;your nemesis is? Has anybody approached this idea yet?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The answer to these things can be simply, \"Yes, it's in the ruleset\" and I need not hear anymore but I'm just curious because it is something that I was always aware of when playing SOTM. Thanks for the help.</p>",
