      "created_at": "2020-04-13T23:41:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, you could simply give a hero a bonus to all actions against that particular villain, and the villain the same against the hero.&nbsp; I'd personally rather tailor something more specific, though--a hero squaring off against their nemesis is a much more significant scenario in an RPG than in the card game.</p>",
